# Local overrides for the Makefiles. Copy to .env (gitignored) and uncomment what
# you want to change. Command-line args still win, e.g.  make serve PORT=9000.
# Format is plain KEY=value (read by `make`); no quotes, no `export`.

# Container engine — auto-detected (podman, else docker). Force one:
# ENGINE=docker

# Preview server (make serve): host interface + port.
# BIND=127.0.0.1
# PORT=8000

# Branch that `make publish-to-branch` commits the built site to (you push it
# separately with your own remote). Defaults to gh-pages.
# BRANCH=gh-pages
